    {
      "fileName": "flamboyant-athlete.json",
      "id": "tmGsnUkPv8SIhBgn",
      "name": "Flamboyant Athlete",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "tmGsnUkPv8SIhBgn",
        "folder": "RXB0Yz1ukXYfyRAG",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Flamboyant Athlete",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your panache allows you to perform incredible feats: climbing, swimming, and leaping far beyond your normal capacity. While you have @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Panache], you gain the following benefits.</p><ul><li>You gain climb and swim Speeds equal to half your land Speed.</li><li>The DCs of your @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.High Jump]{High Jumps} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Long Jump]{Long Jumps} decrease by 10. This doesn't combine with other abilities that reduce those DCs.</li><li>The distance you can move with a vertical @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Leap] increases to 5 feet. Your distance for a horizontal Leap increases to 15 feet if your Speed is at least 15 feet, or to 20 feet if your Speed is at least 30 feet.</li></ul>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 4
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "expert in Athletics"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core 2"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "key": "BaseSpeed",
              "predicate": [
                "self:effect:panache"
              ],
              "selector": "climb",
              "value": "floor(@actor.system.movement.speeds.land.value/2)"
            },
            {
              "key": "BaseSpeed",
              "predicate": [
                "self:effect:panache"
              ],
              "selector": "swim",
              "value": "floor(@actor.system.movement.speeds.land.value/2)"
            }
          ],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "swashbuckler"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 4,
      "category": "class"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "guardians-deflection-swashbuckler.json",
      "id": "YJIzE2RhGRGfbt9j",
      "name": "Guardian's Deflection (Swashbuckler)",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "YJIzE2RhGRGfbt9j",
        "folder": "RXB0Yz1ukXYfyRAG",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Guardian's Deflection (Swashbuckler)",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "reaction"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An ally within your melee reach is hit by an attack, you can see the attacker, and a +2 circumstance bonus to AC would turn the critical hit into a hit or the hit into a miss.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are wielding a single one-handed melee weapon and have your other hand or hands free.</p><hr /><p>You use your weapon to deflect the attack against your ally, granting a +2 circumstance bonus to their AC against the triggering attack. This turns the triggering critical hit into a hit, or the triggering hit into a miss. You gain panache until the end of your next turn.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Guardian's Deflection]</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Panache (Temporary)]</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 4
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core 2"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "swashbuckler"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
